<title>UK: GEC says results announcement delayed.</title>
<headline>GEC says results announcement delayed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric Co Plc (GEC) said on Tuesday that its annual results and strategic review statement had been delayed by technical problems.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the engineering giant said the results had been due out at 0635 GMT. He was unable to comment on the new timing for statement's release.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717.</p>
